+- `RuntimeStatus` model, `read_status(home)`, `is_stale(status, now, after=120.0)`.
+- `record_planned_stop(home, pid, reason)` (W4 `stop` writes it **before** SIGTERM),
+  `read_planned_stop(home)`, `clear_planned_stop(home)`.
